<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept kerosene imports up, gas oil down yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept kerosene imports up, gas oil down yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry issued the following data on Friday on oil product imports during September (barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline     130	  818    -42.7	+25.0</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,111     13,278    -19.0	 -6.7</p>
<p> Kerosene     137	  862    -13.3     +101.5</p>
<p> Gas oil	  5	   31    -88.1	-95.0</p>
<p> Fuel oil A    85	  535    -17.5	+54.5</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   225	1,415    -21.9	+45.2</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
